+            // Fading from the previous cart's backdrop into the new one.
+            //
+            // The outgoing backdrop is drawn fully opaque and the incoming one
+            // fades in on top of it. Compositing two half-transparent layers
+            // over the wallpaper would leak the wallpaper through the middle
+            // of the fade (alpha * (1 - alpha) of it), which shows up as a
